// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Install scripts that are broken as the authors shipped them (replacements): each is a corrected copy of the mod's own
// install script, made on the player's machine from the author's file plus our line edits; install it before the mod, and
// Infinity Keeper then installs the mod from the copy. The mod's own files are never changed. Each was run on a fake game:
// the copy parses (weidu --list-components) where the author's file does not, or finds the files it names.

// Kitanya git-d342de8: kitanya/kitanya.tp2 has one END too many (line 75, after the OUTER_FOR that is already closed on
// line 74), so WeiDU stops with a parse error.
